<!doctype html>
<!--
  Presale (honest pre-order) page for {{product_name}} — stamped by
  chief-wiggum /apply-pattern (presale, #236). EXPERIMENT scaffold, not
  product code.

  INV-PRE-003 (honest framing): the not-built-yet block, the price, and the
  delivery window stay VISIBLE and ABOVE the payment step. A checkout that
  hides non-existence is fraud, not a test.
  INV-PRE-005 (refund-on-kill): the refund policy shown here is a promise the
  kill/pivot path must honor.

  Before launch: pre-register the strength-5 test card —
    python3 scripts/assumption.py card <bet-id> --asm ASM-NNN \
        --method presale --metric visitor_to_preorder_rate_pct \
        --comparator ">=" --value <X> --sample-min <N> --evidence-strength 5
-->
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{product_name}} — pre-order</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 40rem; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .honest { border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 0.5rem; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .price { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; }
    button { padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem; font-size: 1.1rem; cursor: pointer; }
    .fine { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.7; }
    #checkout-error { display: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="honest">
    <strong>{{product_name}} is not built yet.</strong>
    Pre-ordering funds and prioritizes it. Expected delivery:
    <strong>{{delivery_window}}</strong>. If we cancel the product before
    delivery, you are refunded in full. {{refund_policy}}
  </div>

  <h1>{{product_name}}</h1>
  <p class="price">Pre-order: ${{price_usd}}</p>

  <button id="preorder-button">Pre-order for ${{price_usd}}</button>
  <p id="checkout-error">Checkout is not available right now — nothing was charged.</p>

  <p class="fine">
    Payment is processed by our payment provider; we never see your card
    details. Refunds per the policy above.
  </p>

  <script src="checkout.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
